sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Content Handler
    participant F as Frontend Admin
    participant AG as API Gateway<br/>(Ingress)
    participant IC as Inventario Service<br/>(Puerto 8001)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(inventario schema)

    Note over C,DB: CDU 505: Carga Masiva de Películas
    
    C->>F: Prepara JSON con listado de películas
    F->>AG: POST /inventario/catalog/movies/bulk-upsert {BulkPayload}
    AG->>IC: Enruta request
    IC->>DB: SELECT * FROM fn_bulk_upsert_movies($json,$created_by)
    DB-->>IC: {inserted: N, updated: M}
    IC-->>AG: Resultado
    AG-->>F: Confirmación
    F-->>C: Resumen: N insertadas, M actualizadas
